hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2899","###\n Ahmad ibn al-Azhar narrated to us, and I wrote it from his original manuscript. He said: Ya'qub narrated to us, from my father, from Ibn Ishaq, from Yazid ibn Abi Habib al-Misri, from Khalid ibn Abi Imran, from Abu Ayyash, from Jabir ibn Abdullah (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) sacrificed two rams on the day of Eid. Then, when he turned them towards the Qiblah,"
